OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after pedestrian dies
OL,4,Ain crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested in connection
OL,7,Fwith a fatal crash involving a
OL,8,Fpedestrian.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to the crash on the B3247
OL,12,Fat Maker-with-Rame, in Cornwall, at
OL,13,Fabout 08:30 GMT.
OL,15,FThe pedestrian, a man in his 70s, died
OL,16,Fat the scene, police said. His next of
OL,17,Fkin have been informed.
OL,19,FThe force added a man in his 20s was
OL,20,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,21,Fby dangerous driving, and remained in
OL,22,Fpolice custody.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
